      "message": "This tells me what is being done here (it is a summary of the diff) but it does not tell me why this is being done. Is it to get the \"right\" family names? It is to get the right Postscript name? Why does getting the right name off of a font created from data make a difference (since names should only matter for display to the user and for initial collection lookups, neither of which should be operationally important to a font created from data)?",
